# Over the bot, STT sometimes writes the bot's own voice coming back down the
# line, or loops on a sound: "Gold Tiger, three gold, three gold, gold." while
# the bot was explaining Silver / Gold (…59211), "చాలా చాలా మంచి మంచి చాలా మంచి
