                        "'how does it work / how do I use it', walk through the process at a "
                        "high level using only what is written here — NEVER make up menu names, "
                        "screens, buttons or steps; if the steps are not here, simply explain what "
                        "the feature does for them (without saying you don't know the steps) and "
                        "offer a free live demo with our expert to show it practically — three or "
                        "four sentences. Do not add facts, prices or promises that are not here:\n"
                        f"{context}"
                    ),
                )
                # The knowledge base holds recorded sales calls: their numbers can be
                # for another plan (…57944 quoted Silver's 22,500 as Gold lifetime).
                self._add_directive(turn_ctx,
                    role="system",
                    content=(
                        "PRICES: the references above are recordings of old calls — NEVER take "
                        "a price, amount or duration from them. If your answer mentions any "
                        "TallyPrime price, use ONLY this official list (Silver = single user, "
                        "Gold = multiple users), always plus eighteen percent GST:\n"
                        f"{PRICING_FACTS}"
                    ),
